OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers arrested after college
OL,4,Alocked down
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teenagers were arrested after a
OL,7,Fcollege in a city centre was placed on
OL,8,Flockdown on Tuesday.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said armed
OL,11,Fofficers were sent to Swanswell Street,
OL,12,FCoventry, at about 12:40 BST after
OL,13,Freports that a firearm was seen.
OL,15,FAn imitation firearm was found by
OL,16,Fofficers, and two 18-year-old men, two
OL,17,Fboys aged 17 and 16, were arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of possession of a firearm.
OL,19,FPolice said in an update that the
OL,20,Fteenagers have been released on police
OL,21,Fbail as inquiries continue.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
